message: "If you use this software or the results it reproduces, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Brane cluster gases and ghost-free form factors for quantum gravity: verification suite and figure scripts"
abstract: >-
  Verification suite and figure scripts accompanying the manuscript "Brane
  cluster gases and ghost-free form factors for quantum gravity". The suite
  runs 171 independent checks in eleven groups, covering the residue sum rule,
  the pole dichotomy, the power counting, the Poisson generating functional,
  the Euclidean propagator of the Gaussian form factor, the weak-field
  threshold, the Schwinger parametric representation, and the composition of
  transmission amplitudes through a stack of branes.
